OL,3,GNEWSAConstable bids to save 'much
OL,4,Aloved' town feature
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parish constable is asking the public
OL,7,Fto share their thoughts on the
OL,8,Frelocation of a "much loved" St Helier
OL,9,Flandmark.
OL,11,FThe granite apple crusher on King
OL,12,FStreet is due to be moved to Howard
OL,13,FDavis Park as part of a #2.5m
OL,14,FInfrastructure Department project to
OL,15,Frevamp the area including resurfacing
OL,16,Fwork.
OL,18,FThe apple crusher was installed in 1978
OL,19,Fto commemorate Jersey's historic
OL,20,Fcider-making heritage when King Street
OL,21,Fand Queen Street were originally
OL,22,Fpedestrianised.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
