OL,3,GNEWSAConstable bids to save 'much
OL,4,Aloved' town feature
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt Helier Constable Inna Gardiner said
OL,7,Fthe granite landmark was a "beautiful,
OL,8,Fcolourful, much loved feature" which
OL,9,Fshe does not want to see moved and
OL,10,Fasked the public to share their
OL,11,Fopinions on social media.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
